Acknowledgements

Victor Taelin's work helped make Exomina possible. Its persistent memory design
draws inspiration from UniiChat, OptMem, and his proposal for a chat that never
ends: hierarchical summaries, bounded context, preserved original sources and
retrieval of those originals when details matter.

https://github.com/VictorTaelin/UniiChat
https://github.com/VictorTaelin/OptMem
https://gist.github.com/VictorTaelin/91837951a5ce5b38f341ec1ba1df6449

Exomina applies these ideas across multiple AI providers in a local desktop
application, alongside shared notes, configurable permissions and integrated
tools and workflows. The acknowledgement describes design inspiration and does
not replace or alter the terms of the referenced projects.

